1
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:09,620
I remember the Aurigan Reach of old -

2
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:12,060
the time of the Great Expansion.

3
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,860
I was just a boy then.

4
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:17,700
Proudly we went forth,

5
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:22,140
bringing the light of our Coalition to so many systems.

6
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,460
And for what?

7
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:28,980
To see our great kingdom slowly waste away?

8
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:33,580
Year after year, the Council deliberates -

9
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,660
while our economy falters,

10
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:39,060
and the wolves bay at every door.

11
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:41,660
While covetous neighbors plot against us!

12
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:46,860
Well, I say it can go. No. Further.

13
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:50,860
We are here today because if Lady Arano will not act,

14
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:53,060
<b>someone</b> must.

15
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:56,700
I know what I am asking of you.

16
00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,900
You will face former comrades,

17
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:02,580
or even loved ones, on the battlefield.

18
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:05,340
I take up arms against my own niece.

19
00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:06,580
But remember:

20
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:08,420
today we sacrifice,

21
00:01:08,420 --> 00:01:11,260
so that tomorrow we can return our kingdom

22
00:01:11,260 --> 00:01:12,460
to its proper glory.

23
00:01:12,580 --> 00:01:14,500
To its proper strength!

24
00:01:15,020 --> 00:01:17,100
So should you fall tonight -

25
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:18,900
know that you did so

26
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:21,380
as true heroes of the Reach!

27
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:22,860
To your stations!

28
00:01:23,060 --> 00:01:24,620
For The Directorate!

